[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
EffectCraft opens and saves files through the XDG desktop portal, which
needs a D-Bus session bus.  If your desktop does not start one, run
EffectCraft under one, for example with

  dbus-run-session effectcraft

EffectCraft renders with Vulkan when a Vulkan driver is installed and
falls back to OpenGL ES (EGL) otherwise.
Sound goes through ALSA's OSS plugin.
EOM
}
]
